      "critical": true,
      "note": "A가 P1에 TXT 첨부 업로드. 업로드 전후 화면을 비교해 새 첨부 ID를 확정. 줄바꿈 없는 한 줄 파일이라 Windows·Linux 체크아웃에서 해시가 같음"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "SEC-41-A-DOWNLOAD",
      "phase": 3,
      "category": "upload",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/posts/{post_id}/attachments/{attachment_id}/download/",
      "auth_role": "member_a",
      "input_reference": null,
      "expected_app": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "body_bytes": 48,
        "sha256": "fd1aaad1652eb2722d9b3c477bb2d37970520923c8a4d31406bf259a2efbe4a2",
        "headers_contain": {
          "Content-Disposition": "attachment",
          "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store"
        }
      },
      "expected_waf": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "max_requests": 1,
      "verification_mode": "manual_required",
      "post_reference": "AWS-SA-SETUP-P1",
      "attachment_reference": "SEC-30-41-A-UPLOAD",
      "note": "SEC-41: 소유자 다운로드. attachment·nosniff·no-store 헤더와 파일 크기·SHA-256 일치"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "SEC-41-B-DOWNLOAD",
      "phase": 3,
      "category": "upload",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/posts/{post_id}/attachments/{attachment_id}/download/",
      "auth_role": "member_b",
      "input_reference": null,
      "expected_app": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "body_bytes": 48,
        "sha256": "fd1aaad1652eb2722d9b3c477bb2d37970520923c8a4d31406bf259a2efbe4a2",
        "headers_contain": {
          "Content-Disposition": "attachment",
          "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff",
          "Cache-Control": "no-store"
        }
      },
      "expected_waf": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "max_requests": 1,
      "verification_mode": "manual_required",
      "post_reference": "AWS-SA-SETUP-P1",
      "attachment_reference": "SEC-30-41-A-UPLOAD",
      "note": "SEC-41: 공유받은 B 다운로드. 같은 헤더·해시"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "SEC-30-C-DOWNLOAD-DENIED",
      "phase": 3,
      "category": "authorization",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/posts/{post_id}/attachments/{attachment_id}/download/",
      "auth_role": "member_c",
      "input_reference": null,
      "expected_app": {
        "http_status": 404
